	(text "RPi Zero 2 W six-outlet 120 VAC relay board (polycarbonate enclosure) (rev A)\nDomains: LINE (mains, 0 V = L_IN); NEUTRAL (mains, 0 V = L_IN); OUT1 (mains, 0 V = L_IN); OUT2 (mains, 0 V = L_IN); OUT3 (mains, 0 V = L_IN); OUT4\n    (mains, 0 V = L_IN); OUT5 (mains, 0 V = L_IN); OUT6 (mains, 0 V = L_IN); PE (other, 0 V = PE); SELV (selv, 0 V = GND)\nBarrier SELV/LINE: reinforced, 187 V working, creepage 8 mm, clearance 8 mm (UL/IEC 62368-1 Tables 10 and 17; IEC 60664-1 Tables F.1, F.2, F.4)\nBarrier LINE/OUT1: functional, 187 V working, creepage 2.5 mm, clearance 1.5 mm (IPC-2221B Table 6-1 B2; IEC 60664-1 F.2 2.5 kV)\nBarrier LINE/OUT2: functional, 187 V working, creepage 2.5 mm, clearance 1.5 mm (IPC-2221B Table 6-1 B2; IEC 60664-1 F.2 2.5 kV)\nBarrier LINE/OUT3: functional, 187 V working, creepage 2.5 mm, clearance 1.5 mm (IPC-2221B Table 6-1 B2; IEC 60664-1 F.2 2.5 kV)\nBarrier LINE/OUT4: functional, 187 V working, creepage 2.5 mm, clearance 1.5 mm (IPC-2221B Table 6-1 B2; IEC 60664-1 F.2 2.5 kV)\nBarrier LINE/OUT5: functional, 187 V working, creepage 2.5 mm, clearance 1.5 mm (IPC-2221B Table 6-1 B2; IEC 60664-1 F.2 2.5 kV)\nBarrier LINE/OUT6: functional, 187 V working, creepage 2.5 mm, clearance 1.5 mm (IPC-2221B Table 6-1 B2; IEC 60664-1 F.2 2.5 kV)\nBarrier LINE/NEUTRAL: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier NEUTRAL/OUT1: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier NEUTRAL/OUT2: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier NEUTRAL/OUT3: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier NEUTRAL/OUT4: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier NEUTRAL/OUT5: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier NEUTRAL/OUT6: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier OUT1/OUT2: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier OUT1/OUT3: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier OUT1/OUT4: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier OUT1/OUT5: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier OUT1/OUT6: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier OUT2/OUT3: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier OUT2/OUT4: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier OUT2/OUT5: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier OUT2/OUT6: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier OUT3/OUT4: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier OUT3/OUT5: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier OUT3/OUT6: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier OUT4/OUT5: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier OUT4/OUT6: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier OUT5/OUT6: functional, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 3.2 mm (UL 1059 / UL 508 practice)\nBarrier LINE/PE: basic, 187 V working, creepage 6.4 mm, clearance 6.4 mm (IEC 62368-1 basic; UL field wiring to dead metal)\nNOT READY FOR FABRICATION — blocking questions: Q-1, Q-6, Q-7, Q-8"
